      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَشْيَانُ</span></b> , (S, K, TA,) originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَشْوَانُ</span>, like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَدْيَانُ</span> [q. v.] which is originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَدْوَانُ</span>, (TA,)
